*> vybe-test: cobol/category_call_returning/test_call_ret_string_and_numeric_mix
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_category_call_returning.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. T. DATA DIVISION. WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256). 01 INX PIC 9 VALUE 3. 01 S PIC X(1). PROCEDURE DIVISION. CALL 'S1' RETURNING S USING INX. DISPLAY S.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING S DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "4"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [4] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF. STOP RUN. IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. S1. DATA DIVISION. LINKAGE SECTION. 01 A PIC 9. 01 R PIC X(1). PROCEDURE DIVISION RETURNING R USING A. IF A = 3 MOVE '4' TO R ELSE MOVE '0' TO R END-IF. EXIT PROGRAM. END PROGRAM S1.

